          "channels": [
            "High-pitched female voice",
            "Lower-pitched radio/synthetic voice"
          ],
          "competition": "Both voices speak simultaneously for 5 seconds ('If you see unarmed ships in the lanes, please ignore them...' vs '...area... please annotate as hostile...').",
          "consequence": "Opposite or competing rules of engagement (ignore vs annotate as hostile) mask each other, making both hard to parse on first pass."
