          "end_s": 57.6,
          "account": "The instructor explains the ship's center gem hitbox, how to hold focus for slow movement, and how to hold fire to shoot upward.",
          "threat_origin": "Voice states at 53.5s that 'up is where the problems are' and mentions threading the gem between bullets (38.2s).",
          "action_response": "Voice confirms the listener is holding focus at 41.6s ('Good, still focusing, great!'), followed by instruction to hold fire at 50.4s.",
          "goal_resource_change": "Tutorial advances from focus practice to weapon firing instruction.",
          "uncertainty": "Whether the player actually fired weapons after 50.4s cannot be determined because there are no distinct gunfire sound effects over the music."
        }
      ],
      "heard": [
        {
          "at_s": 8.2,
          "words": "Great job pressing the left key! Now for your next challenge, press the right key.",
          "source": "Enthusiastic female instructor voice",
          "confidence": "high"
        },
        {
          "at_s": 25.4,
          "words": "Your ship is large and beautiful, but only the small glowing gem at its center can be hit. Please protect the gem, the gem is you.",
          "source": "Enthusiastic female instructor voice",
          "confidence": "high"
        },
        {
          "at_s": 48.7,
          "words": "Now let's learn to fire. Hold fire to release bullets. Bullets go up. Up is where the problems are.",
